  "prefLabel": "Int 101.08 Interpreter referral service",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-12-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Int 101.08 \"Interpreter referral service\" means a service the function of which is to find and refer to the requesting party an interpreter licensed under RSA 326-I who is appropriate to the assignment.\n\nSource. #7851, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11 (from Int 101.07)",
